{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8cc243d8-4376-856b-a3c0-5828f21f8caa",
  "created_at": "2026-01-16T14:14:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marco Iannuccilli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:07:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:07:46-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon, Denise. I hope you are having a good Friday and that you are warm in there. My name is Marco Iannuccilli. Thank you for taking my call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:08:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Marco, I'm doing fine. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:08:11-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Please, first, I want to say the city has always been very kind to me and my family. I have a small business, and I am very grateful to be in Newport. So I do not like to call with a complaint."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:08:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Go ahead, I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:08:40-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is about the snow. The plow, he came by on, um, Wednesday, I think, very early. But the street is still not good. There is snow packed in the middle and the sides, and the cars cannot get out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:09:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. What street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:09:08-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I am at 461 Memorial Boulevard. By Easton's Beach side. [pause] Daddy, one minute. Sorry, Denise, my youngest, he is asking me for a snack."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:09:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. So 461 Memorial Boulevard. Is it the whole street that's not cleared, or just your stretch?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:09:36-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Our end. We are on the dead end, you know. The last part. And always, every time, the dead end is plowed last. Sometimes the plow does not even come all the way. He turns around before. It is like this every time, and I say this with respect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:10:05-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. The dead ends do tend to come at the end of the route, that's just how the routes run. But if it's not passable, that's something we should send somebody back for."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:10:26-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, thank you. This is what I am asking. Please, can a plow come back? Only one time, to open it so the cars can pass. [pause] No, habibi, wait, I told you, in a minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:10:48-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Ha, sounds like he's persistent. How wide is it right now, can a car get through at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:11:00-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A small car, maybe, very slowly. My delivery van, no. I cannot get it out. And every thirty seconds, he asks, Baba, a snack, Baba, a snack. I am sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:11:18-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Don't apologize, I've got kids too. Let me put this in as a request for a return pass at 461 Memorial. Is there a lot of snow banked at the end where it turns around?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:11:39-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a lot. The big pile at the end, from the plow. It is like a wall. And it has become ice, because of the cold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:11:55-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so that's the turnaround. I'll note that the crew needs to push that back too. Can I get a phone number in case the supervisor has questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:12:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. It is 401-555-0186."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:12:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0186. Got it. And it's Iannuccilli, how do you spell that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:12:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I-A-N-N-U-C-C-I-L-L-I. It is a hard one, everybody says so. [pause] Yes, you may have the crackers, take the crackers. Sorry, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:12:36-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're fine. I-A-N-N-U-C-C-I-L-L-I. Perfect. So I've got it down, return plow to the dead end, clear the packed snow and the pile at the turnaround."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:12:51-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Thank you very much. When do you think he will come? Today, maybe? Because I have deliveries tomorrow morning, very early."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:13:05-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't give you a time, Marco. The crews are on a list and I don't see the schedule from here. Usually these requests get worked within a day or so, but I'll mark it as access for a business vehicle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:13:29-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A day, I understand. But it is the third time this winter I have to call about the same thing. I hope this time he comes before the weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:13:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand, and I'll flag that it's a repeat for that street. That helps them prioritize."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:13:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. You are very kind. Please, if the supervisor can call me, I will answer, even if I am in the van."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:14:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:14:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. God bless you and your family, Denise, and have a very nice weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:14:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Marco. Take care, and enjoy the snacks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T14:14:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
